WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Assign units to a parcel
Match the purchased item and parcel, enter a positive whole quantity,
explain the work and save a draft. Partial drafts are allowed; unsaved
quantities cannot be confirmed.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Refresh an outdated snapshot deliberately
A competing change blocks this stale vendor command. Quantities and
explanation remain on screen. Refresh, inspect the current revision and
reconsider before submitting again.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Confirm complete packing, not dispatch
Every remaining unit is assigned. The store confirmed revision 6 after
reopening and voiding an unused parcel. The order remains confirmed and
unpaid, with no handoff or delivery.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Inspect the record with platform oversight
Platform admins can read the store, seller, quantities and receipt
trail. They cannot save, confirm, reopen, void or create parcels from
this oversight screen.
